003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow fast can a Dubai LED supplier deliver and install?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eStocked indoor panels can be installed within 1–2 weeks; custom pitch, outdoor or curved builds typically take 3–6 weeks including production and QC. Beware suppliers promising complex builds in days — panels without proper factory calibration show visible batch differences.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eDoes Brightluxx have a showroom I can visit before buying?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes — our showroom and warehouse in Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1 runs live COB, MiP and SMD demo walls so you can compare image quality at your real viewing distance. Book a visit via the contact page; bring your own content on USB to see it on screen.\\u003c/p\\u003e10:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$11\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Top LED Screen Suppliers in Dubai | Brightluxx Solutions\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Find reliable LED screen suppliers in Dubai. Brightluxx offers premium LED displays with expert service. Request a quote today!\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/led-screen-suppliers-dubai\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"ViewportBou