\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}]],\"$L10\"]}]\n11:T7dd,<h1>Top LED Screen Suppliers in Dubai | Brightluxx Solutions</h1><p>Find reliable LED screen suppliers in Dubai. Brightluxx offers premium LED displays with expert service. Request a quote today!</p><h2>LED Display FAQs — Choosing a Dubai Supplier</h2><h3>How do I compare LED screen suppliers in Dubai?</h3><p>Compare on five things: a physical showroom you can visit (not just a trading office), factory-direct panel sourcing, in-house installation teams, local spare-module stock, and written warranty with defined response times. Ask each supplier for delivered project addresses in Dubai you can go and see.</p><h3>What warranty should a Dubai LED supplier offer?</h3><p>A serious supplier offers a minimum 2-year comprehensive warranty extendable to 5 years, covering modules, power supplies and receiving cards — with spare modules stocked locally in the UAE so repairs happen in days, not import cycles. Brightluxx includes local spares with every installation.</p><h3>Should I buy directly from China instead of a Dubai supplier?</h3><p>Factory-direct import can look 15–25% cheaper on paper but leaves you without installation, DEWA/municipality compliance, calibration, warranty logistics and after-sales support. Most importers end up paying more fixing issues than a Dubai supplier would have charged end-to-end.</p><h3>How fast can a Dubai LED supplier deliver and install?</h3><p>Stocked indoor panels can be installed within 1–2 weeks; custom pitch, outdoor or curved builds typically take 3–6 weeks including production and QC. Beware suppliers promising complex builds in days — panels without proper factory calibration show visible batch differences.</p><h3>Does Brightluxx have a showroom I can visit before buying?</h3><p>Yes — our showroom and warehouse in Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1 runs live COB, MiP and SMD demo walls so you can compare image quality at your real viewing distance. Book a visit via the contact page; bring your own content on USB to see it on screen.</p>10:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$11\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Top LED Screen Suppliers in Dubai | Brightluxx Solutions\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Find reliable LED screen suppliers in Dubai. Brightluxx offers premium LED displays with expert service. Request a quote today!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/led-screen-suppliers-dubai\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"led-screen-suppliers-dubai\",\"siblings\":[\"products\"]},\"prefetchHints\":4192,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"__PAGE__\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4256,\"slots\":null}}}}},\"staleTime\":300,\"buildId\":\"0VevTopRFbkV79u