ype\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A serious supplier offers a minimum 2-year comprehensive warranty extendable to 5 years, covering modules, power supplies and receiving cards — with spare modules stocked locally in the UAE so repairs happen in days, not import cycles. Brightluxx includes local spares with every installation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Should I buy directly from China instead of a Dubai supplier?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Factory-direct import can look 15–25% cheaper on paper but leaves you without installation, DEWA/municipality compliance, calibration, warranty logistics and after-sales support. Most importers end up paying more fixing issues than a Dubai supplier would have charged end-to-end.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How fast can a Dubai LED supplier deliver and install?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Stocked indoor panels can be installed within 1–2 weeks; custom pitch, outdoor or curved builds typically take 3–6 weeks including production and QC. Beware suppliers promising complex builds in days — panels without proper factory calibration show visible batch differences.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does Brightluxx have a showroom I can visit before buying?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes — our showroom and warehouse in Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1 runs live COB, MiP and SMD demo walls so you can compare image quality at your real viewing distance. Book a visit via the contact page; bring your own content on USB to see it on screen.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"WebPage\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Top LED Screen Suppliers in Dubai | Brightluxx Solutions\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Find reliable LED screen suppliers