ious supplier offers a minimum 2-year comprehensive warranty extendable to 5 years, covering modules, power supplies and receiving cards — with spare modules stocked locally in the UAE so repairs happen in days, not import cycles. Brightluxx includes local spares with every installation.</p><h3>Should I buy directly from China instead of a Dubai supplier?</h3><p>Factory-direct import can look 15–25% cheaper on paper but leaves you without installation, DEWA/municipality compliance, calibration, warranty logistics and after-sales support. Most importers end up paying more fixing issues than a Dubai supplier would have charged end-to-end.</p><h3>How fast can a Dubai LED supplier deliver and install?</h3><p>Stocked indoor panels can be installed within 1–2 weeks; custom pitch, outdoor or curved builds typically take 3–6 weeks including production and QC. Beware suppliers promising complex builds in days — panels without proper factory calibration show visible batch differences.</p><h3>Does Brightluxx have a showroom I can visit before buying?</h3><p>Yes — our showroom and warehouse in Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1 runs live COB, MiP and SMD demo walls so you can compare image quality at your real viewing distance. Book a visit via the contact page; bring your own content on USB to see it on screen.</p>10:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$11\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Top LED Screen Suppliers in Dubai | Brightluxx Solutions\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Find reliable LED screen suppliers in Dubai. Brightluxx offers premium LED displays with expert service. Request a quote today!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/led-screen-suppliers-dubai\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fra